shil.com/about"/><meta property="og:title" content="Find Out Who We Are | Panchshil Realty"/><meta property="og:description" content="Panchshil  Realty is one of the luxury real estate developers in  Pune established in 2002 renowned for leadership and excellence in real estate development sector."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://www.panchshil.com/about"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="Panchshil Realty"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/banners/1778496376571-452619124.webp"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Find Out Who We Are | Panchshil Realty"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Find Out Who We Are | Panchshil Realty"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Panchshil  Realty is one of the luxury real estate developers in  Pune established in 2002 renowned for leadership and excellence in real estate development sector."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/banners/1778496376571-452619124.webp"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico?favicon.9b9b8af2.ico" sizes="48x48" type="image/x-icon"/><link rel="icon" href="/assets/images/favicon-32x32.png" sizes="32x32" type="image/png"/><link rel="icon" href="/assets/images/favicon-16x16.png" sizes="16x16" type="image/png"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/images/apple-touch-icon.png"/><script>(self.__next_s=self.__next_s||[]).push([0,{"children":"\n            // Prevent jQuery errors if GTM tags require it\n            (function() {\n              if (typeof window.jQuery === 'undefined' && typeof window.$ === 'undefined') {\n                var createNoop = function() {\n                  var noop = function() { return noop; };\n                  noop.ready = function(fn) { \n                    if (document.readyS