hil\",\"image\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/assets/images/home/logo.png\",\"telephone\":\"+912066473200\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Tech Park One, Tower E, 191\",\"addressLocality\":\"Pune\",\"addressCountry\":\"INDIA\",\"postalCode\":\"411 006\"},\"url\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/\"}]","id":"structured-data"}])</script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="open_sans_d8233d88-module__jxwt5W__variable zapfhumanist601roman_933a60ba-module__V23Kka__variable zapfhumanist601bold_3b9fc64b-module__EgBeuG__variable zapfhumanist601semi_36224895-module__cNrlFa__variable zapfhumanist601ultra_94fd03eb-module__rN8M9q__variable antialiased"><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class="min-h-screen bg-[#FFFAF7]"><header class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out"><div class="absolute shadow inset-0 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out opacity-0"></div><div class="relative max-w-[1920px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12"><div class="relative flex justify-start md:justify-center items-center transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out pt-8 pb-4"><a class="flex flex-col items-center" href="/"><div class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out scale-100"><img alt="Panchshil" loading="lazy" width="98" height="98" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="transition-all duration-300" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fpanchshil-logo.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fpanchshil-logo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fpanchshil-logo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/></div></a><button type="button" class="md:hidden absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col gap-1.5 items-center justify-center rounded-full transition-colors duration-300 text-white" aria-label="Toggle navigation menu"><span class="block w-6 h-0.5 transition-transform duration-300 bg-white "></span><span class="block w-6 h-0.5 transition-opacity duration-300 bg-white opacity-100"></span><span class="block w-6 h-0.5 transition-transform duration-300 bg-white "></span></button></div><nav class="hidden md:flex justify-center"><ul class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 lg:gap-12 transition-colors duration-300 text-white"></ul></nav></div><div class="md:hidden fixed inset-0 z-40 transition-opacity opacity-0 pointer-events-none"><div class="fixed top-0 right-0 h-full w-64 bg-white text-black shadow-2xl transform transition-transform duration-300 translate-x-full"><div class="flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 border-b border-gray-100"><button type="button" class="text-black-chocolate text-2xl" aria-label="Close menu">×</button></div><nav class="p-6"><ul class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-black-chocolate"></ul></nav></div></div></header><section class="min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-white"><section class="relative w-full flex-1 overflow-hidden bg-white min-h-[500px] md:min-h-[620px]"><img alt="Crafting Exceptional Spaces Since 2002" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2F1778496376571-452619124.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2F1778496376571-452619124.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2F1778496376571-452619124.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2F1778496376571-452619124.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2F1778496376571-452619124.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2F1778496376571-452619124.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2F1778496376571-452619124.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2F1778496376571-452619124.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fbanners%2F1778496376571-452619124.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-black/35"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 z-10 flex items-end justify-center pb-14 md:pb-20 px-6 md:max-w-2xl mx-auto"><div class="w-full max-w-[960px] text-center"><h1 class="animate-fade-in-up text-2xl md:text-[28px] font-display-semi text-white mb-6 tracking-tight">Crafting Exceptional Spaces Since 2002</h1><p class="animate-fade-in-up-delay-1 text-lg md:text-lg lg:text-lg text-white/90 max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed">From homes to commercial destinations, from India to global shores-we build more than structures. We shape lifestyles, communities and legacies.</p><div class="animate-fade-in-up-delay-2 mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4"></div></div></div></section><section class="z-40 w-full bg-[#F2EEEA] h-auto md:h-[104px] border-y border-black/10 transition-all duration-300 relative"><div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-x-5 gap-y-2"><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-4 md:py-5 md:after:absolute md:after:right-0 md:after:top-1/2 md:after:-translate-y-1/2 md:after:h-10 md:after:w-px md:after:bg-black/20"><span class="text-2xl md:text-[28px] leading-none font-display-semi text-black-chocolate">0<!-- --> Mn+</span><span class="mt-1 text-base md:text-[20px] leading-tight font-display-semi text-black-chocolate text-center">Sq. Ft. Delivered</span></div><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-4 md:py-5 md:after:absolute md:after:right-0 md:after:top-1/2 md:after:-translate-y-1/2 md:after:h-10 md:after:w-px md:after:bg-black/20"><span class="text-2xl md:text-[28px] leading-none font-display-semi text-black-chocolate">0<!-- --> Mn+</span><span class="mt-1 text-base md:text-[20px] leading-tight font-display-semi text-black-chocolate text-center">Sq. Ft. Under Construction</span></div><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-4 md:py-5 md:after:absolute md:after:right-0 md:after:top-1/2 md:after:-translate-y-1/2 md:after:h-10 md:after:w-px md:after:bg-black/20"><span class="text-2xl md:text-[28px] leading-none font-display-semi text-black-chocolate">0<!-- -->+</span><span class="mt-1 text-base md:text-[20px] leading-tight font-display-semi text-black-chocolate text-center">Countries Present In</span></div><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-4 md:py-5 "><span class="text-2xl md:text-[28px] leading-none font-display-semi text-black-chocolate">0</span><span class="mt-1 text-base md:text-[20px] leading-tight font-display-semi text-black-chocolate text-center">Asset Classes</span></div></div></div></section></section><section class="bg-white py-14 md:py-20"><div class="max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 lg:px-12 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div><div class="text-sm md:text-base text-black/80 leading-relaxed max-w-[640px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 whitespace-pre-line">There was a time we set out to build differently. Today, that difference is the standard. Pune's skyline now carries our name on it, not as a single statement, but as a body of work spanning office parks, luxury residences, landmark hotels and lifestyle experiences the city calls its own.

From Pune to international markets, Panchshil's name today stands for a way of building, living and growing that others look to. Cities change, formats change, ambitions grow, but the standard we hold ourselves to remains constant. What comes next isn't just a continuation of our legacy. It's the next benchmark, and we're already building toward it.</div></div><div class="mt-5"><h3 class="text-black/85 text-lg py-1 font-display-semi">ATUL CHORDIA</h3><p class="text-black/85 text-sm md:text-base py-1 ">Chairman - Panchshil Realty</p></div></div><div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img alt="Atul Chordia, Chairman, Panchshil Realty" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fatul-chordia-804299115.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fatul-chordia-804299115.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fatul-chordia-804299115.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fatul-chordia-804299115.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fatul-chordia-804299115.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fatul-chordia-804299115.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fatul-chordia-804299115.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fatul-chordia-804299115.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.panchshil.com%2Fasset%2Fimages%2Fabout%2Fatul-chordia-804299115.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div></section><section class="w-full bg-[#FFFAF7] py-14 md:py-20"><div class="mx-auto "><div class="text-center mb-10"><div class="text-lg uppercase font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-beige mb-2">Our Vision</div><h2 class="text-2xl uppercase md:text-[28px] font-display-semi transition-colors">India’s most aspirational luxury real estate brand</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm md:text-base max-w-[800px] mx-auto leading-relaxed">To be India’s most aspirational luxury real estate brand, by setting benchmarks in design, quality, innovation and sustainability, which create enduring value for customers, communities, and stakeholders.</p></div></div></section><section class="bg-white py-14 md:py-20"><div class="max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 lg:px-12 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16"><div><p class="text-lg uppercase font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-beige mb-2">Our Mission</p><h2 class="text-2xl uppercase md:text-[28px] font-display-semi transition-colors">Function, Form, and Finish</h2></div><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden">Guided by our brand philosophy of balancing Function, Form, and Finish, we design, develop, and operate world-class real estate through thoughtful design, strong execution, and future-ready, sustainable safe and environmentally responsible practices delivering exceptional quality, efficiency, and long-term value.</div></div></section><section class="w-full py-10 md:py-10 transition-colors bg-[#FFFAF7]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-10 justify-center items-center text-center"><div class="text-center}"><div class="text-lg uppercase font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-beige mb-2 ">What we stand for</div><h2 class="text-2xl uppercase md:text-[28px] font-display-semi transition-colors text-black">Core Values</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-10 px-10 text-left"><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 px-5 py-10 border border-black/10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display-semi text-black-chocolate mb-5">Integrity And Transparency</h2><p class="text-black/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">We uphold the highest standards of ethics, ensuring transparency, accountability, strong governance and compliance across all our operations.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 px-5 py-10 border border-black/10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display-semi text-black-chocolate mb-5">Respect and Inclusion</h2><p class="text-black/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">We foster a culture of respect, fairness, and inclusion, ensuring safe and equitable environments for our employees, partners, and stakeholders.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 px-5 py-10 border border-black/10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display-semi text-black-chocolate mb-5">Excellence in Execution</h2><p class="text-black/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">We deliver with discipline and precision, driven by robust processes, quality standards, and a commitment to continuous improvement.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 px-5 py-10 border border-black/10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display-semi text-black-chocolate mb-5">Design Excellence</h2><p class="text-black/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">We create thoughtfully designed spaces that seamlessly integrate functionality, elevate form, and achieve the highest standards of finish.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 px-5 py-10 border border-black/10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display-semi text-black-chocolate mb-5">Health, Safety and Well-being</h2><p class="text-black/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">We prioritise safe workspaces and construction sites and healthy built environments for the safety and well-being of our employees, with a zero-harm mindset across construction and facility management operations.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 px-5 py-10 border border-black/10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display-semi text-black-chocolate mb-5">Environmental Responsibility</h2><p class="text-black/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">We integrate sustainable and resource-efficient practices across design, construction, and operations to minimise environmental impact and support a low-carbon future.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 px-5 py-10 border border-black/10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display-semi text-black-chocolate mb-5">Community Impact</h2><p class="text-black/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">We contribute to the social and economic development of communities through responsible development and meaningful engagement.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="w-full bg-white py-15"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 justify-center items-center"><h2 class="text-2xl uppercase md:text-[28px] font-display-semi transition-colors">Commitment Statement</h2><p class="text-sm md:text-base max-w-[900px] leading-relaxed text-center">We do not just build landmarks, we create spaces that are thoughtfully designed, responsibly built, and sustainably operated.<br/>
<br/>
