-[0.2em] text-gold-beige mb-2 ">WE ARE NOW EXPANDING</div><h2 class="text-2xl uppercase md:text-[28px] font-display-semi transition-colors text-black text-black">FROM PUNE TO THE WORLD</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm md:text-base max-w-[800px] mx-auto leading-relaxed text-black/80">With developments in Dubai, the Maldives, Sri Lanka and across Indian cities, Panchshil brings global design sensibilities and international standards to every address - while remaining deeply attuned to the needs and aspirations of each community.</p></div><div class="flex md:gap-4 md:flex-row flex-col justify-center"></div></div></section></div><section class="bg-[#FFFAF7] py-16 md:py-24 relative"><div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-12"><div class="flex justify-end mb-8 gap-3"><button aria-label="Previous" disabled="" class="grid place-items-center text-[#B09E81] transition-opacity opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="18" fill="#9E8C70" class="bi bi-arrow-left" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M15 8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5H2.707l3.147-3.146a.5.5 0 1 0-.708-.708l-4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 0 .708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708-.708L2.707 8.5H14.5A.5.5 0 0 0 15 8"></path></svg></button><button aria-label="Next" disabled="" class="grid place-items-center text-[#B09E81] transition-opacity opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="18" fill="#9E8C70" class="bi bi-arrow-left" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1 8a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h11.793l-3.147-3.146a.5.5 0 0 1 .708-.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708l-4 4a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L13.293 8.5H1.5A.5.5 0 0 1 1 8"></path></svg></button></div><div class="embla overflow-hidden"><div class="embla__container flex"><div class="embla__slide basis-full shrink-0 grow-0 min-w-0"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-16 items-center"><div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-[16/11]"><img alt="Sustainability" loading="lazy" decoding="a