80 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-center w-full max-w-[560px] mx-auto">At panchshil, growth isn&#x27;t just about building landmark structures, it&#x27;s about creating enduring value for communities, environment and the future. Our commitment extends beyond architecture and urban infrastructure, it&#x27;s rooted in sustainable development, ethical governance and a people first culture</p><div class="w-full flex justify-center"><a href="/esg"><button class="px-4 py-3 cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-90 transition-all shadow-sm w-fit bg-gold-beige text-white">Visit ESG Page</button></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div><section class="w-full py-10 md:py-20 bg-white"><div class="mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-12 px-4 md:px-0 opacity-0"><div class="text-lg font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-beige mb-2"></div><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-[28px] font-display-semi text-black">OUR VALUED CLIENTS</h2></div><div class="relative w-full opacity-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-3 mb-4 mr-8"><button aria-label="Previous" disabled="" class="grid place-items-center text-gold-beige transition-opacity opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="18" fill="#9E8C70" class="bi bi-arrow-left" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M15 8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5H2.707l3.147-3.146a.5.5 0 1 0-.708-.708l-4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 0 .708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708-.708L2.707 8.5H14.5A.5.5 0 0 0 15 8"></path></svg></button><button aria-label="Next" disabled="" class="grid place-items-center text-gold-beige transition-opacity opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="18" fill="#9E8C70" class="bi bi-arrow-left" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1 8a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h11.793l-3.147-3.146a.5.5 0 0 1 .708-.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708l-4 4a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L13.293 8.5H1.5A.5.5 0 0 1 1 8"></path></svg></button></div><div class="relative