ordia, Chairman, Panchshil Realty\",\"about_intro_name\":\"ATUL CHORDIA\",\"about_intro_designation\":\"Chairman - Panchshil Realty\"},\"milestones\":{\"title\":\"GROWTH CHRONICLES\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"milestones\":[{\"year\":\"2026\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Launch of 57 Avenue in Pune\",\"content\":\"Launch of 57 Avenue in Pune\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launch-of-57-avenue-in-pu-212777580.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2025\",\"title\":\"GLOBAL EXPANSION\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Completed Panchshil Business Hub, Eon West II and NTT Nav 2 - Airoli DC – Phase I\",\"content\":\"Completed Panchshil Business Hub, Eon West II and NTT Nav 2 - Airoli DC – Phase I\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/completed-panchshil-busin-215637083.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Completed acquisition with a majority stake in Hilton Goa\",\"content\":\"Completed acquisition with a majority stake in Hilton Goa\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/completed-acquisition-wit-270039805.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Launch of Nukkad – Pune's first organised hawkers park\",\"content\":\"Launch of Nukkad – Pune's first organised hawkers park\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launch-of-nukkad-punes-946250617.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Launch of Omnia Residences, Mumbai\",\"content\":\"Launch of Omnia Residences, Mumbai\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launch-of-omnia-residence-22823846.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Global expansion in 2020\"},{\"year\":\"2024\",\"title\":\"TODAY \u0026 BEYOND\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Completed construction of our first international development - Raaya by Atmosphere in the Maldives\",\"content\":\"Completed construction of our first international development - Raaya by Atmosphere in the Maldives\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/completed-construction-of-427132027.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Public listing of Ventive Hospitality on the stock exchange, promoted by Panchshil Realty and Blackstone Real Estate Partners with a focus on owning, developing and operating high-quality hotel assets\",\"content\":\"Public listing of Ventive Hospitality on the stock exchange, promoted by Panchshil Realty and Blackstone Real Estate Partners with a focus on owning, developing and operating high-quality hotel assets\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/public-listing-of-ventive-747925492.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Acquisition of Aloft ORR Bengaluru, Anantara Maldives and Conrad Maldives\",\"content\":\"Acquisition of Aloft ORR Bengaluru, Anantara Maldives and Conrad Maldives\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/acquisition-of-aloft-orr-737908194.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Completed Panchshil Avenue in Pune\",\"content\":\"Completed Panchshil Avenue in Pune\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/completed-panchshil-avenu-28693892.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Panchshil today and future vision\"},{\"year\":\"2023\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Acquired Brownfield Hotel in Varanasi, Uttar Pradesh and Aloft Bengaluru Whitefield Hotel in Karnataka\",\"content\":\"Acquired Brownfield Hotel in Varanasi, Uttar Pradesh and Aloft Bengaluru Whitefield Hotel in Karnataka\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/acquired-brownfield-hotel-658845764.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Launch of The Golden Bell I\",\"content\":\"Launch of The Golden Bell I\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launch-of-the-golden-bell-8076153.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Completion of Eleven West office park in Baner\",\"content\":\"Completion of Eleven West office park in Baner\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/completion-of-eleven-west-17532072.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Commenced construction of Lumina Panchshil JV - LBOMI\",\"content\":\"Commenced construction of Lumina Panchshil JV - LBOMI\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/commenced-construction-of-236899284.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2022\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Commenced construction of Panchshil Business Hub and Vantage office parks in Kharadi\",\"content\":\"Commenced construction of Panchshil Business Hub and Vantage office parks in Kharadi\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/commenced-construction-of-825368156.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2021\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Commenced construction of EON West I \u0026 II office park in Wakad\",\"content\":\"Commenced construction of EON West I \u0026 II office park in Wakad\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/commenced-construction-of-148997520.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2020\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Launched SOHO in Kharadi\",\"content\":\"Launched SOHO in Kharadi\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-soho-in-kharadi-571618469.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Commenced construction of Panchshil Business Park East in Viman Nagar\",\"content\":\"Commenced construction of Panchshil Business Park East in Viman Nagar\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/commenced-construction-of-879612639.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2019\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Launched EON Free Zone Phase II in Kharadi\",\"content\":\"Launched EON Free Zone Phase II in Kharadi\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-eon-free-zone-ph-339354865.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Launched The Ritz-Carlton, Pune\",\"content\":\"Launched The Ritz-Carlton, Pune\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-the-ritz-carlton-35743564.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2018\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Launched the world's first YOO-branded villas - YOO Villas styled by Kelly Hoppen CBE in Kharadi\",\"content\":\"Launched the world's first YOO-branded villas - YOO Villas styled by Kelly Hoppen CBE in Kharadi\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-the-worlds-firs-55329599.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2017\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Acquired First International Financial Centre (FIFC), BKC, Mumbai, with Blackstone\",\"content\":\"Acquired First International Financial Centre (FIFC), BKC, Mumbai, with Blackstone\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/acquired-first-internatio-474883359.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Launched The Pavillion Mall on Senapati Bapat Road\",\"content\":\"Launched The Pavillion Mall on Senapati Bapat Road\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-the-pavillion-ma-274560055.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Commenced construction of Panchshil Business Park West in Balewadi\",\"content\":\"Commenced construction of Panchshil Business Park West in Balewadi\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/commenced-construction-of-654525932.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2016\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Rebranded Oakwood Premier to Marriott Suites\",\"content\":\"Rebranded Oakwood Premier to Marriott Suites\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/rebranded-oakwood-premier-362873217.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Commenced construction of EON Free Zone Phase II in Kharadi\",\"content\":\"Commenced construction of EON Free Zone Phase II in Kharadi\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/commenced-construction-of-712693608.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2015\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Signed an MoU with the Government of Maharashtra to develop four IT projects jointly with Blackstone across Mumbai and Pune\",\"content\":\"Signed an MoU with the Government of Maharashtra to develop four IT projects jointly with Blackstone across Mumbai and Pune\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/signed-an-mo-u-with-the-go-287326153.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Launched Avant Garde, Panchshil's first premium residences in Friends Colony, New Delhi\",\"content\":\"Launched Avant Garde, Panchshil's first premium residences in Friends Colony, New Delhi\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-avant-garde-pan-654043949.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2014\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Delivered a built-to-suit office park for Cummins India in Balewadi\",\"content\":\"Delivered a built-to-suit office park for Cummins India in Balewadi\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/delivered-a-built-to-suit-95608716.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Acquired Express Towers in Nariman Point, Mumbai, with Blackstone\",\"content\":\"Acquired Express Towers in Nariman Point, Mumbai, with Blackstone\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/acquired-express-towers-i-593581986.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Delivered Business Bay near Pune Golf Course on Airport Road\",\"content\":\"Delivered Business Bay near Pune Golf Course on Airport Road\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/delivered-business-bay-ne-167470569.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2013\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Upgraded Pune Marriott Hotel and Convention Centre to JW Marriott Hotel Pune\",\"content\":\"Upgraded Pune Marriott Hotel and Convention Centre to JW Marriott Hotel Pune\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/upgraded-pune-marriott-ho-108554180.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Launched DoubleTree by Hilton Pune - Chinchwad\",\"content\":\"Launched DoubleTree by Hilton Pune - Chinchwad\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-double-tree-by-hi-188326190.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Launched India's first Trump-branded residences, Trump Towers Pune in Kalyani Nagar\",\"content\":\"Launched India's first Trump-branded residences, Trump Towers Pune in Kalyani Nagar\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-indias-first-tr-634807235.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2012\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Launched Panchshil Towers in Kharadi, Panchshil's first home-branded premium high-rise residential project\",\"content\":\"Launched Panchshil Towers in Kharadi, Panchshil's first home-branded premium high-rise residential project\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-panchshil-towers-424879370.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2010\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Launched Pune Marriott Hotel and Convention Centre on Senapati Bapat Road\",\"content\":\"Launched Pune Marriott Hotel and Convention Centre on Senapati Bapat Road\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-pune-marriott-ho-940549641.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Launched yoopune by Philippe Starck in Hadapsar\",\"content\":\"Launched yoopune by Philippe Starck in Hadapsar\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-yoopune-by-phili-301498987.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Launched World Trade Center Pune in Kharadi\",\"content\":\"Launched World Trade Center Pune in Kharadi\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-world-trade-cent-936565318.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2009\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Launched Oakwood Residence, the first internationally branded serviced residence on Naylor Road\",\"content\":\"Launched Oakwood Residence, the first internationally branded serviced residence on Naylor Road\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-oakwood-residenc-288538565.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2006\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Launched EON Free Zone Phase I, a 4.5 million sq. ft. IT \u0026 ITES SEZ in Kharadi\",\"content\":\"Launched EON Free Zone Phase I, a 4.5 million sq. ft. IT \u0026 ITES SEZ in Kharadi\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-eon-free-zone-ph-882265134.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2004\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Received Foreign Direct Investment from Merrill Lynch\",\"content\":\"Received Foreign Direct Investment from Merrill Lynch\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/received-foreign-direct-i-497313989.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2003\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Commenced construction of Tech Park One in Yerwada\",\"content\":\"Commenced construction of Tech Park One in Yerwada\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/commenced-construction-of-382224064.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"},{\"year\":\"2002\",\"title\":\"LANDMARK DELIVERIES\",\"description\":[{\"title\":\"Delivered a built-to-suit office park for AXA Business Services on Bund Garden Road\",\"content\":\"Delivered a built-to-suit office park for AXA Business Services on Bund Garden Road\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/delivered-a-built-to-suit-329284641.webp\"},{\"title\":\"Launched ICC on Senapati Bapat Road\",\"content\":\"Launched ICC on Senapati Bapat Road\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/growth-chronicles/launched-icc-on-senapati-423256797.webp\"}],\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/about/growth-chronicles-2024.png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Landmark project deliveries in 2015\"}]},\"sustainability\":{\"slides\":[{\"imageSrc\":\"/assets/images/esg/esg-hero-banner.png\",\"title\":\"CARING FOR PEOPLE, PLANET \u0026 LEGACY\\nOUR SUSTAINABILITY PROMISE\",\"description\":\"At panchshil, growth isn't just about building landmark structures, it's about creating enduring value for communities, environment and the future. Our commitment extends beyond architecture and urban infrastructure, it's rooted in sustainable development, ethical governance and a people first culture\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Visit ESG Page\",\"ctaHref\":\"/esg\"}]},\"ourValuedClients\":[{\"property_key_tenant_caption\":\"Bajaj\",\"property_key_tenant_image\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/about/clients/bajaj-902498334.webp\"},{\"property_key_tenant_caption\":\"Cognizant\",\"property_key_tenant_image\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/about/clients/cognizant-161007632.webp\"},{\"property_key_tenant_caption\":\"Credit Suisse\",\"property_key_tenant_image\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/about/clients/credit-suisse-245288007.webp\"},{\"property_key_tenant_caption\":\"Cummins\",\"property_key_tenant_image\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/about/clients/cummins-424886522.webp\"},{\"property_key_tenant_caption\":\"Deloitte\",\"property_key_tenant_image\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/about/clients/deloitte-364990003.webp\"},{\"property_key_tenant_caption\":\"Deutsche Bank\",\"property_key_tenant_image\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/about/clients/deutsche-bank-138322362.webp\"},{\"property_key_tenant_caption\":\"EY\",\"property_key_tenant_image\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/about/clients/ey-466398959.webp\"},{\"property_key_tenant_caption\":\"IBM\",\"property_key_tenant_image\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/about/clients/ibm-543731674.webp\"},{\"property_key_tenant_caption\":\"Mastercard\",\"property_key_tenant_image\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/about/clients/mastercard-19972679.webp\"},{\"property_key_tenant_caption\":\"NVIDIA\",\"property_key_tenant_image\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/about/clients/nvidia-493911736.webp\"}],\"alliances\":{\"title\":\"ALLIANCES THAT SHAPE OUR WORK\",\"tabs\":[{\"tabLabel\":\"INSTITUTIONAL PARTNERS\",\"slides\":[{\"title\":\"Blackstone\",\"description\":\"Blackstone is one of the world's leading investment firms that seek to create positive economic impact and long-term value for its investors, the companies it invests in, and the communities in which it works. Blackstone's global business platform encompasses private equity and real estate funds, hedge fund solutions, and credit funds.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.blackstone.com/\"},{\"title\":\"GIC, Singapore\",\"description\":\"Established in 1981 to manage Singapore's foreign reserves, GIC strives to achieve good long-term real returns on assets under our management to preserve and enhance the value of Singapore's reserves. They have investments in over 40 countries and are headquartered in Singapore, with 10 offices in key financial cities worldwide.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.gic.com.sg/\"},{\"title\":\"Morgan Stanley\",\"description\":\"Morgan Stanley mobilizes capital to help governments, corporations, institutions and individuals around the world achieve their financial goals. A consistent industry leader throughout decades in modern finance, Morgan Stanley continues to break new ground in advising, serving and providing new opportunities for its clients.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.morganstanley.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Meryll Lynch\",\"description\":\"Merrill Lynch is an American investment management and wealth management division of Bank of America. Along with BofA Securities, the investment banking arm, both firms engage in prime brokerage and broker-dealer activities. The firm is headquartered in New York City\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.ml.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Xander\",\"description\":\"The Xander Group Inc. is a private equity firm based out of London, the United Kingdom with offices in Singapore and India. It is focused on long-term, value investing, primarily in companies that operate in the infrastructure, hospitality, retail, and real estate markets.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"http://www.xandergroup.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Ireo\",\"description\":\"Ireo is a leading property developer in India. Since establishing its presence in 2004, it has assembled one of the largest property portfolios in India, with a focus on the Delhi NCR (including Gurgaon), Punjab, Tamil Nadu and Goa regions. The Ireo portfolio is owned by affiliated investment funds that are backed by global blue-chip investors and financial institutions.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.ireoworld.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Apollo Global Management\",\"description\":\"Apollo is a high-growth, global alternative asset manager. In their asset management business, they seek to provide our clients excess return at every point along the risk-reward spectrum from investment grade to private equity with a focus on three investing strategies: yield, hybrid, and equity.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.apollo.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Lumina CloudInfra\",\"description\":\"Lumina CloudInfra builds high-quality, secure cloud infrastructure in India and the world. With over 175 years of collective industry experience, Lumina’s leadership is among the most reputed in the business. The team is well-versed in developing, leasing and operating data center infrastructure.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.luminadc.com/\"},{\"title\":\"ALTA CAPITAL\",\"description\":\"Alta Capital is an investment \u0026 asset management firm established in 2021, headquartered in Mumbai, India. They seek to invest in real estate assets and early-stage proptech companies across the capital stack with significant underlying growth potential.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://altacaps.com/\"}]},{\"tabLabel\":\"HOSPITALITY BRAND PARTNERS\",\"slides\":[{\"title\":\"Courtyard by Marriott\",\"description\":\"Courtyard by Marriott is a chain of hotels that provide serene, comfortable environments in a home-like atmosphere to ease the stress of daily life. Founded in 1983 and owned by Marriott International, the Courtyard hotels span the globe with over 1,000 locations worldwide, including North and South America, Asia, Europe and the United States.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.marriott.com/en/destinations/pune.mi\"},{\"title\":\"JW Marriott\",\"description\":\"JW Marriott is a world-class luxury hotel brand providing an environment of simple elegance. The hotel orchestrating experiences that open guests up to the world around them. The JW Marriott experience is authentically reflected in the surroundings, the sense of harmony and wellness, and beautiful lasting memories. At JW Marriott, guests indulge in ultimate luxury.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.marriott.com/en-us/hotels/pnqmc-jw-marriott-hotel-pune/overview/\"},{\"title\":\"Oakwood\",\"description\":\"Founded in 1960, Oakwood remains the world's leading provider of furnished and serviced corporate apartments and residences. With over 25,000 locations throughout North America, Latin America, Europe, the Middle East and Africa and the Asia Pacific region, Oakwood offers a full spectrum of housing solutions to meet the needs of businesses and individuals.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.oakwood.com/\"},{\"title\":\"The Ritz-Carlton\",\"description\":\"With an unshakeable credo and corporate philosophy of unwavering commitment to service, both in their hotels and communities, The Ritz-Carlton has been recognized with numerous awards for being the gold standard of hospitality. Established in 1983 with the purchase of The Ritz-Carlton, Boston, the company has grown from one hotel to 81 hotels worldwide.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.ritzcarlton.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Soho House Mumbai\",\"description\":\"Soho House is a club for creatives. We exist to provide a home for our members to come together and belong, wherever they are in the world. It all began in 1995, when founder Nick Jones opened the first Soho House on London’s Greek Street above his restaurant, Cafe Boheme. Soho House was so named, because it was situated in a Georgian house\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.sohohouse.com/en-us/\"},{\"title\":\"Atmosphere Core (Atmosphere Hotels and Resorts)\",\"description\":\"Atmosphere Hotels \u0026 Resorts (a sub-brand of Atmosphere Core) aims to provide a rich diversity of experiences through seven well-defined sub-brand options giving property owners maximum flexibility while leveraging world class, turnkey solutions. The sub-brand portfolio includes ATMOSPHERE.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.atmospherecore.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Radisson Blu\",\"description\":\"Radisson Blu is a part of the Radisson Hotel Group portfolio which also includes Radisson Collection, Radisson, Radisson RED, Radisson Individuals, Park Plaza, Park Inn by Radisson, Country Inn \u0026 Suites by Radisson, and prizeotel brought together under one commercial umbrella brand Radisson Hotels.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.radissonhotels.com/en-us/brand/radisson-blu\"},{\"title\":\"Aloft Hotels\",\"description\":\"Aloft hotels are always popping up in the most unexpected places, lighting cities all over the world with a social spark. Each of the 100+ Aloft hotels is ultra-unique, but all share a sense of excitement that leaves guests amazed and abuzz. Aloft® is designed for the next generation of travelers and features clean, contemporary architecture\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://aloft-hotels.marriott.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Double Tree by Hilton Hotels\",\"description\":\"DoubleTree by Hilton hotels are distinctively designed properties that provide true comfort to today’s business and leisure travelers. From the millions of delighted hotel guests who are welcomed with the brand’s legendary,warm chocolate chip cookies at check-in to the advantages of the award-winning Hilton HHonors®\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.hilton.com/en/brands/doubletree-by-hilton\"}]},{\"tabLabel\":\"BRAND ASSOCIATION\",\"slides\":[{\"title\":\"The Trump Organization\",\"description\":\"The Trump Organization is the world's only global luxury real estate super-brand and known for many of the world's most recognized developments. Trump is renowned for its leadership in real estate development, sales and marketing, and property management, representing the highest level of excellence and luxury in residential, commercial and retail properties.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.trump.com/\"},{\"title\":\"yoo\",\"description\":\"YOO is a pioneering vision for living and the result of a partnership between property entrepreneur John Hitchcox and the ubiquitous designer, Philippe Starck. Since 1999, YOO has worked with international developers, designing landmark residential and hotel projects throughout Asia, Australia, Europe, Africa, North and South America and the Middle East.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.yoo.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Kelly Hoppen\",\"description\":\"Kelly Hoppen a Designer, Entrepreneur, Author, and Educator and Britain’s celebrated stylist with her calm, elegant interior design aesthetic has achieved iconic and much-imitated status worldwide. The Kelly Hoppen for yoo style fuses together the eastern principles of simplicity and balance with the western tastes for sumptuous textures and luxurious finishes.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.yooresidences.com/designer/kelly-hoppen/\"},{\"title\":\"The World Trade Centers Association\",\"description\":\"The World Trade Centers Association stimulates trade and investment opportunities for commercial property developers, economic development agencies, and international businesses looking to connect globally and prosper locally. WTCA serves as an 'international ecosystem' of global connections, iconic properties, and integrated trade services under the umbrella of a prestigious brand.\",\"linkLabel\":\"Read More\",\"linkHref\":\"https://www.wtca.org/\"}]}]},\"metaData\":{},\"vision\":{\"about_vision_title\":\"Our Vision\",\"about_vision_caption\":\"India’s most aspirational luxury real estate brand\",\"about_vision_description\":\"To be India’s most aspirational luxury real estate brand, by setting benchmarks in design, quality, innovation and sustainability, which create enduring value for customers, communities, and stakeholders.\"},\"mission\":{\"about_mission_title\":\"Our Mission\",\"about_mission_caption\":\"Function, Form, and Finish\",\"about_mission_description\":\"Guided by our brand philosophy of balancing Function, Form, and Finish, we design, develop, and operate world-class real estate through thoughtful design, strong execution, and future-ready, sustainable safe and environmentally responsible practices delivering exceptional quality, efficiency, and long-term value.\"},\"core_values_intro\":{\"about_core_values_intro_title\":\"What we stand for\",\"about_core_values_intro_caption\":\"Core Values\"},\"core_values\":[{\"core_value_title\":\"Integrity And Transparency\",\"core_value_description\":\"We uphold the highest standards of ethics, ensuring transparency, accountability, strong governance and compliance across all our operations.\"},{\"core_value_title\":\"Respect and Inclusion\",\"core_value_description\":\"We foster a culture of respect, fairness, and inclusion, ensuring safe and equitable environments for our employees, partners, and stakeholders.\"},{\"core_value_title\":\"Excellence in Execution\",\"core_value_description\":\"We deliver with discipline and precision, driven by robust processes, quality standards, and a commitment to continuous improvement.\"},{\"core_value_title\":\"Design Excellence\",\"core_value_description\":\"We create thoughtfully designed spaces that seamlessly integrate functionality, elevate form, and achieve the highest standards of finish.\"},{\"core_value_title\":\"Health, Safety and Well-being\",\"core_value_description\":\"We prioritise safe workspaces and construction sites and healthy built environments for the safety and well-being of our employees, with a zero-harm mindset across construction and facility management operations.\"},{\"core_value_title\":\"Environmental Responsibility\",\"core_value_description\":\"We integrate sustainable and resource-efficient practices across design, construction, and operations to minimise environmental impact and support a low-carbon future.\"},{\"core_value_title\":\"Community Impact\",\"core_value_description\":\"We contribute to the social and economic development of communities through responsible development and meaningful engagement.\"}],\"commitment_intro\":{\"about_commitment_intro_title\":\"Commitment Statement\",\"about_commitment_intro_description\":\"We do not just build landmarks, we create spaces that are thoughtfully designed, responsibly built, and sustainably operated.\\r\\n\\r\\nEvery project reflects our commitment to excellence in function, form, and finish, backed by the highest standards of quality, innovation, safety, ESG and responsibility, creating long-term value for our customers, stakeholders and the communities we serve.\"},\"videoBanner\":{\"about_video_caption\":\"WE STAND FOR UNWAVERING QUALITY, \\r\\nTHOUGHTFUL DESIGN AND ENDURING VALUE.\",\"about_video_youtube_id\":\"BwmXliCqYso\",\"about_intro_video_thumbnail\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/about/we-stand-for-unwavering-quality-thoughtful-design-and-enduring-value-491240321.webp\"},\"globalIntroduction\":{\"global_heading\":\"WE ARE NOW EXPANDING\",\"global_caption\":\"FROM PUNE TO THE WORLD\",\"global_description\":\"With developments in Dubai, the Maldives, Sri Lanka and across Indian cities, Panchshil brings global design sensibilities and international standards to every address - while remaining deeply attuned to the needs and aspirations of each community.\"},\"esg\":{\"about_esg_caption\":\"CARING FOR PEOPLE, PLANET \u0026 LEGACY OUR SUSTAINABILITY PROMISE\",\"about_esg_description\":\"At panchshil, growth isn't just about building landmark structures, it's about creating enduring value for communities, environment and the future. Our commitment extends beyond architecture and urban infrastructure, it's rooted in sustainable development, ethical governance and a people first culture\",\"about_esg_image\":\"https://www.panchshil.com/asset/images/about/caring-for-people-planet-legacy-our-sustainability-promise-153271517.webp\"}}}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"19:I[27201,[\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/117bfe402b75b387.js\"],\"IconMark\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"c:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Find Out Who We Are | Panchshil Realty\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Panchshil  Realty is one of the luxury real estate developers in  Pune established in 2002 renowned for leadership and excellence in real estate development sector.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/assets/site.webmanifest\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"